    "detailed_description": "<h1>Featured DLC</h1><p>Great music for your ears! The soundtrack includes more than 5 tracks! The soundtrack will be available for purchase after game release!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WELCOME TO DOTS!</h2>Dots! An exciting game built on an easy and relaxed gaming experience. You just need to relax and enjoy the gameplay for many hours.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to play?</h2>Just click or tap at any screen position to shoot the dot, and don't touch the dots on the circle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Replayability!</h2>More than one thousand two hundred levels that will drag you on for long game hours with the possibility of full replayability!",
